      "source_text": "——以及，左脚的疼痛。",
      "source_fingerprint": "53a2f99acecc920bb9297b7af443b91f4c2777da04ff339462355f9ddb887a92",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
