    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f858b63169098d0649cf07d5",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "在森林里找到失去意识的爱织后，\n我急忙叫了救护车，把她送来了医院。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5dcf7426ff905c1a8a01ebf5d4b7f84cadb824d5eedb05f55877d4c56cfc9712",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1033/storytimeline_501033115.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
