      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        88,
        "choice_data_list",
        0
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/88/choice_data_list/0"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:02c9a2cf6af1173952f7a7be",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "在那期间，她一直呻吟着。\n我则一直、一直呼唤着她。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4bcb483b2d700581cb43c6e06ecb24b9ccfa80ce008a668835a094b8226e5bd3",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1033/storytimeline_501033115.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        88,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/88/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a4016d47e4aaa004dff38c18",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "她终于恢复了意识。\r\n但是，她只是迷茫地看着我——",
      "source_fingerprint": "adb58c9fed1ff50c0539c6cd1e013f1bef316c1ab53956ea71bfb4ec33f8ffc0",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1033/storytimeline_501033115.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        89,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/89/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fcb7016c22ed85393537e635",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "爱织！终于找到你了……！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "8d9c656412ead22a35ed4ba95d0adbcb6b6b75c27f814c8822c3d262dcbf9e0e",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
