    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:278d9bd1ac099a0317786e5c",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我的妹妹……她……\r\n……彻底……消失了……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "40bbd8b7998bdf0e03de18195b63984f24138eac0ab83ef143592984d476b310",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1033/storytimeline_501033115.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        93,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/93/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e6d949cc6d70c9f0126c7d5e",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "爱慕织姬紧紧抱住我，痛哭了起来。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c5e5bdff93d6941504f2295e60458248881b21ecd633e9f4becf90448afde70c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1033/storytimeline_501033115.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        94,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/94/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e170dbdbed553059b15b70c9",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "她的手指陷进我的皮肤、\r\n被她抱住的地方传来微微的疼痛——",
      "source_fingerprint": "a250de9d809d007ad20bb5adae606060398b08fbf379dc0dd664a7464e0f412e",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1033/storytimeline_501033115.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        95,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/95/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3e57664a64f110640fc333a3",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "但是，这比起她自己感受到的那般痛楚，\n我所承受的也许还不足万分之一吧。",
